# 开发机是 Windows、CI 是 Linux：脚本必须带 LF，否则 runner 上 ./gradlew 报
# "bad interpreter: No such file or directory"。
* text=auto
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.java text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# 模型 / 贴图等二进制不要被文本规范化碰到
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ogg binary
*.jar binary
*.bbmodel binary
